ce owners remain in the ledger.&#10;Source constraints, algorithm behavior and omitted ports are unconverted; no simulation claim." vertex="1" parent="1" sourceIds="_18_5_3_4100178_1528678196980_540894_21097 _18_5_3_4100178_1528595830665_33956_25055 _18_5_3_4100178_1527870062763_957594_17984" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=IBM Plex Sans;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="45" y="1045" width="1110" height="82.95" /></mxCell><mxCell id="WFC-01-endpoint-ledger-57" value="NIST source 3be053a2 · static diagram ID/author Fig. 12(b) matched · notice accompanies derivatives." vertex="1" parent="1" sourceIds="" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=IBM Plex Sans;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="45" y="1155" width="1110" height="30.3" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>